      "description": "State $04 (0x012680) returns to State 2 on +$37 bit 1; helper 0x01269A resets State 0 (+$2A=0) and clears cooldown +$9E. State $08 (0x0126AC) accelerates via 0x01274C until +$37 bit 1 -> State $12 (+$2A=$1A, +$2=$0A). State $12 (0x0126CE) sets +$90 = (($FF0DB7 + 1) >> 2), calls 0x00BCA4(d0=0), clears +$90, steps 0x01274C, and decrements +$2 -> State $14 (+$2A=$1C) after 10 frames. State $14 (0x012702) decelerates by (0xC0,0xC0) via 0x00E2D4, integrates +$72/+$76, and enters idle with +$9E=$0E on +$37 bit 1. 0x01274C adds (0x100,0x100) via 0x00E2D4 and clamps +$4E/+$52 to [-$80000..+$80000]."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Efreet_FlameBreathStates",
      "start": "0x0127A4",
      "end": "0x012802",
      "size_bytes": 94,
      "instruction_count": 24,
      "sub_entry_points": {
        "state_0a_flame_breath_startup": "0x0127A4",
        "state_0e_flame_breath_active": "0x0127C0"
      },
      "description": "State $0A (0x0127A4) waits for +$37 bit 1 to enter State $0E (+$2A=$18, +$2=$46 = 70 frames). State $0E (0x0127C0) decrements +$2; when +$2 >= $14 (20) and (+$2 & 3) == 0, spawns flame particles via 0x012DFA + SFX #$80034F, runs 0x012CDC and 0x012EA8 every active frame, and on 0 frees the $FF1C1C slot pointed to by +$A6(a6), clears +$6(a6), and branches to 0x01269A."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Efreet_FireballSupernovaStates",
      "start": "0x012802",
      "end": "0x012914",
      "size_bytes": 274,
      "instruction_count": 71,
      "sub_entry_points": {
