        "state_18_supernova_spawner": "0x012818",
        "state_1a_supernova_recovery": "0x01284C",
        "state_18_spawn_fireball_branch": "0x012858"
      },
      "description": "State $0C (0x012802) waits for +$37 bit 1 -> State $18 (+$2A=$1E). State $18 (0x012818, 0x012858) writes screen shake $FF17C4 = ($FF1971 & 1) + 3; while +$2 >= 0 after decrement, plays SFX #$B00224 and #$700383. On +$2 borrow, decrements +$AF (transitioning to State $1A +$2A=$20 on underflow), resets +$2=2, steps +$AE -= $20, looks up signed trig bytes at $05D706 scaled by $1000 (vx = cos*0x1000, vy = -sin*0x1000), allocates a $FF1C1C Pool 1 slot via 0x00DA1A (reverting +$2/+$AE/+$AF if full), clones Efreet via 0x00E66E, sets State $16 (+$2A=$16), +$A2=$FF, priority (+$18 & $8000)|$07A8, offsets +$8/+$C by 2*vel. State $1A (0x01284C) exits to 0x01269A on +$37 bit 1."
    },
