      "description": "State $16 (0x012914..0x012950) maps velocity (+$4E, +$52) to cardinal facing via 0x00E338 into +$16, executes 0x00BCA4(d0=2), clears +$16, despawns (+$0=0) on +$37 bit 1, or integrates +$4E/+$52 into +$72/+$76. State $10 (0x012950..0x012978, jumped from 0x0129B0) applies (($FF0DB7 + 1) >> 2) into +$90, calls 0x00BCA4(d0=0), clears +$90, and returns via 0x01269A on +$37 bit 1. 0x012978..0x012988 plays insufficient-SP/slot-full SFX #$00A00253 via $60004 and branches to 0x0129B0."
    }
